<ans># Niva Bupa Health Insurance Ltd — H1FY26 Financial Data
### Six Months Ended 30 September 2025

Figures below were extracted directly from the three primary statutory/IR documents (OCR'd and read in full). The Reg. 74(5) certificate and the investor-relations.aspx listing page were checked but contained no incremental NL-1/NL-2 statutory disclosures beyond what is already embedded in the Reg. 33/52 statutory results filing — so that filing serves as the authoritative source for NWP, NEP, EoM ratio, claims ratio, combined ratio, and solvency ratio.

<div style="border-left:4px solid #1E3A8A;background:#EFF6FF;padding:8px 12px;margin:8px 0;border-radius:4px;">
<strong>Basis note:</strong> GWP figures are reported on the <strong>"with 1/n" (statutory) basis</strong> throughout, per sourcing priority. The deck's "without 1/n" GWP (₹3,982.7 cr) and Retail Health GWP (₹2,809.9 cr) were excluded to preserve basis consistency with the statutory filing.
</div>

