ember\n\n## terim Condensed IFRS Financial er 30,2025\n\n## 13. Insurance Contracts Issued and Reinsurance Contracts Held\n\nThe following tables show the concentration of net insurance service revenue by group of contracts:\n\n(Rs. in lakhs)\n\n| Particulars Group of Contracts | For the period ended September 30, 2025 Insurance Service Revenue | For the period ended September 30, 2025 Reinsurance Cession | For the period ended September 30, 2025 Net Retained | For the period ended September 30, 2024 Insurance Service Revenue | For the period ended September 30, 2024 Reinsurance Cession | For the period ended September 30, 2024 Net Retained |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Retail | 2,55,113 | 60,776 | 1,94,337 | 1,97,285 | 47,166 | 1,50,119 |\n| Group | 1,11,655 | 15,698 | 95,957 | 74,017 | 10,502 | 63,515 |\n| Total net insurance contracts | 3,66,768 | 76,474 | 2,90,294 | 2,71,302 | 57,668 | 2,13,634 |\n\n## 14. Insurance Service Expense\n\nThe breakdown of insurance service expenses by major product lines is presented below:\n\nFor the period ended September 30,2025\n\n(Rs. in lakhs)\n\n| Particulars | Retail | Group | Total |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Incurred claims and other expenses | 1,73,799 | 67,990 | 2,41,789 |\n| Amortisation of insurance acquisition cash flows | 74,954 | 36,687 | 1,11,641 |\n| Losses on onerous contracts and reversals of those contracts | - | - | - |\n| Total | 2,48,753 | 1,04,677 | 3,53,430 |\n\nFor the period ended September 30,2024\n\n(Rs. in lakhs)\n\n| Particulars | Retail | Group | Total |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Incurred claims and other expenses | 1,34,133 | 41,349 | 1,75,482 |\n| Amortisation of insurance acquisition cash flows | 59,267 | 24,314 | 83,581 |\n| Losses on onerous contracts and reversals of those contracts | - | - | - |\n| Total | 1,93,400 | 65,663 | 2,59,063 |\n\nAs per our report of even date attached\n\nFor S.R. Batliboi & Co Chartered Accountant ICAI Firm Registration 301003E/E300005\n